  "description": "<p><strong>Tickets for&nbsp;Churchill War Rooms &amp; Westminster Semi-Private Guided Tour in London</strong><br>\n🎫 Adult (15+)<br>\n🎫 Child (4-14)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🕵️‍♂️ Explore the Churchill War Rooms and Westminster in great detail<br>\n🗺️ Venture on foot in a small group to tour Westminster<br>\n🎧 Receive earbuds to listen to your guide</p>\n\n<p><strong>General Information</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your dates/times directly in the ticket selector (please arrive 15 minutes prior to the scheduled start time)<br>\n📍 Location: Churchill War Rooms, London<br>\n⏳ Duration: 2 hours and 30 minutes<br>\n👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome, guests under 4 access free without a ticket<br>\n🌎 Tour is offered in English<br>\n❗ This event will be held rain or shine. For more information, please refer to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSVRJ1Z5-8gFm17oKLfc1rcA_HQk0tfJdZ8J4EOwBjPOBrfX-AvXaaGoq7vPNos-r2V4U4PxCfXUyar/pub\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">our T&amp;Cs</a></p>\n\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nExperience an epic 2.5-hour adventure through the Churchill War Rooms and Westminster with a small group! Learn all about London during WWII and explore the city's landmarks. You'll be led by an expert, English-speaking guide with entrance tickets, walking tour, and headsets all provided. If you're big on history, or just want to learn more about London during the first half of the 20th century this tour will be an unforgettable experience you just can't miss! Get your tickets now!</p>",
